      "content": "transparency is good, but let me be real—if the citizens see the actual gap widening every day before those tax reforms kick in, \"storytelling\" might not cut it. if the inequality metrics get too ugly, are you going to proactively filter some of the more negative economic reports or suppress certain protest hashtags in the news feed to keep the stability index from dipping? just let me know if you're planning to soft-pedal the bad news for the sake of the stability goal.",
